Lore doc. Subject to final approval by Amanda Stanley. 

//Stews and Brews for the hangry Orc://

/A heaping of Cruel Gruel./ 

Vulture bones picked clean mixed with bore teeth - such a crunchy delight to eat. 
Served with a side of eye and tickled pickled bear belly slathered in snail jelly. 

Dragon wing tips dipped in molten lava peppered with minced flying squirrel. 
Served hot with live squealing vampire bat - what better use for a flying rat. 

/Squeazes to quench a battle parched throat./

Mammoth snot spritzed with fresh poison toad served ice cold. 

Behemoth blood spiced with agitated cobra venom - one per orc 'cause it'll get 'em. 

//Notes from staff//
Cook: What to concoct today for tongues that have tasted everything? 
Servant: I must impress, I must impress thy Royal Highness! 
Gardener: These confounded new plants tried to eat me! 
Cleaner: Everyday a new mess with the young sir and everyday a new lesson learned. 
Castle Guard: I pledge these fists to protect the royal family or my name isn't Knock-Knock. 